<title>USA: Snap-On holders approve increase in share.</title>
<headline>Snap-On holders approve increase in share.</headline>
<dateline>KENOSHA, Wis. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Snap-On Inc said shareholders on Friday approved an amendment increasing the total number of authorized shares of common stock to 250 million shares from 125 million.</p>
<p>At the end of the first quarter, the company had 60.9 million average shares outstanding.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
